OL,3,GNEWSAFatal explosion a 'household
OL,4,Aaccident', police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fatal explosion in South Yorkshire is
OL,7,Fbelieved to have been caused by a
OL,8,F"household accident", according to
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FClifton Mount in Rotherham at 13:18 BST
OL,13,Fon Tuesday, with a man found dead at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FClifton Mount was closed off to allow
OL,17,Femergency services to work but later
OL,18,Freopened.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
