OL,3,GNEWSAFatal explosion a 'household
OL,4,Aaccident', police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update on Wednesday, South
OL,7,FYorkshire Police said: "While the exact
OL,8,Fcause of the explosion has not yet been
OL,9,Fconfirmed, at this stage in our
OL,10,Finvestigation we believe it to have
OL,11,Fbeen caused by a household accident.
